  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "UdQlaGzrIKUx9MKVF-lDm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 481.2809807151107,
      "y": 113.0234375,
      "width": 630.4296875,
      "height": 1500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1333807293,
      "version": 1106,
      "versionNonce": 618387123,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1743096664095,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional requirements:\n\n1. Store key value pair of data\n2. Support various data types for values\n3. Provide fetching and updating of cache values\n4. Support expiry and configurable eviction policy\n\nScale:\n1. 1M TPS\n\nNon functional requirements:\n\n1. Scalability: Support 1M TPS\n2. Highly available: Replication in case of node failure\n3. Availability >> consistency --> Eventual consistency\n4. Low latency (<< 1ms)\n\nBack of the envelope calculation:\n\n1. \nreads: 1M TPS reads\nwrites: 100k TPS\n\nstorage: 100K * 20B ~ 2MB \nper day: 2MB * 10^5 ~ 200 GB\nper year: 200GB * 365 ~ 70000GB ~ 70TB\n\nCore entities:\n\n1. CacheEntry\nid\nkey\nvalue\ntimestamp\nttl\n\nAPIs/SDKs/Library:\n\n1. GET /api/v1/key/{keyName}\nResponse ->\n{\n    \"value\": \"\",\n    \"timestamp\": 2024030000,\n    \"ttl\": \"\"\n}\n\n404 -> Not found\n\n2. POST /api/v1/\n{\n    \"key\": \"\",\n    \"value\": {}\n}\n\n3. PUT /api/v1/key/{keyName}\n{\n    \"value\": \"\"\n}\n\n4. DELETE /api/v1/key{keyName}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional requirements:\n\n1. Store key value pair of data\n2. Support various data types for values\n3. Provide fetching and updating of cache values\n4. Support expiry and configurable eviction policy\n\nScale:\n1. 1M TPS\n\nNon functional requirements:\n\n1. Scalability: Support 1M TPS\n2. Highly available: Replication in case of node failure\n3. Availability >> consistency --> Eventual consistency\n4. Low latency (<< 1ms)\n\nBack of the envelope calculation:\n\n1. \nreads: 1M TPS reads\nwrites: 100k TPS\n\nstorage: 100K * 20B ~ 2MB \nper day: 2MB * 10^5 ~ 200 GB\nper year: 200GB * 365 ~ 70000GB ~ 70TB\n\nCore entities:\n\n1. CacheEntry\nid\nkey\nvalue\ntimestamp\nttl\n\nAPIs/SDKs/Library:\n\n1. GET /api/v1/key/{keyName}\nResponse ->\n{\n    \"value\": \"\",\n    \"timestamp\": 2024030000,\n    \"ttl\": \"\"\n}\n\n404 -> Not found\n\n2. POST /api/v1/\n{\n    \"key\": \"\",\n    \"value\": {}\n}\n\n3. PUT /api/v1/key/{keyName}\n{\n    \"value\": \"\"\n}\n\n4. DELETE /api/v1/key{keyName}",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
