      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1743096957419,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Consistent hashing -> \n\nhash(key) % N = server1\n\nN = 0 - 100\n\n0 - 10 : server1\n10 - 20 : server2\n...\n40 - 50 : server1\n...\n90 - 100 : serverN\n\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Consistent hashing -> \n\nhash(key) % N = server1\n\nN = 0 - 100\n\n0 - 10 : server1\n10 - 20 : server2\n...\n40 - 50 : server1\n...\n90 - 100 : serverN\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
